# fastlane
#
# It is recommended to not store the screenshots in the git repo. Instead, use fastlane to re-generate the
# screenshots whenever they are needed.
# For more information about the recommended setup visit:
# https://docs.fastlane.tools/best-practices/source-control/

**/fastlane/report.xml
**/fastlane/Preview.html
**/fastlane/screenshots
**/fastlane/test_output

# Bundle artifact
*.jsbundle

# Ruby / CocoaPods
**/Pods/
/vendor/bundle/

# Signing secrets & build output (fastlane ghi ra ios/ khi build local hoặc CI)
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
ios/builds/

# Temporary files created by Metro to check the health of the file watcher
.metro-health-check*

# testing
/coverage

# Yarn
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions

# Environment variables
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
env/.*
!env/.example
# Generated by scripts/generate-ios-env.sh on every build
ios/tmp.xcconfig
android/coop-dev-firebase.json
.claude
*.lock
# Gemfile.lock phải được commit: CI chạy `bundle install` mỗi run, không pin thì
# fastlane tự nhảy lên bản mới nhất và hành vi ký (update_code_signing_settings,
# sigh, gym) có thể đổi mà không có commit nào liên quan.
!ios/Gemfile.lock
!android/Gemfile.lock
codepush_build/*